Obviously, she's a grieving mother.

1552
01:03:23,180 --> 01:03:23,660
Yeah.

1553
01:03:24,120 --> 01:03:24,840
She's grief stricken.

1554
01:03:24,960 --> 01:03:25,580
And they say.

