Her hair is gray.

1557
01:03:29,580 --> 01:03:30,440
She's not wearing jewels.

1558
01:03:30,640 --> 01:03:31,600
She looks terrible.

1559
01:03:31,940 --> 01:03:34,580
I mean, you know, it's understandable.

1560
01:03:35,140 --> 01:03:37,560
And she seems to be forcing back tears.

1561
