And she brings out her children, Marie-Thérèse and Louis.

1562
01:03:41,420 --> 01:03:42,960
Marie-Thérèse is ten and Louis is four.

1563
01:03:43,340 --> 01:03:47,420
And she brings them out, which is the royal family have never done anything like this

1564
01:03:47,420 --> 01:03:47,740
before.

1565
01:03:47,940 --> 01:03:49,860
And the crowd go mad.

1566
01:03:49,960 --> 01:03:51,740
They're cheering and all this kind of stuff.

1567
01:03:52,800 --> 01:03:54,660
But I always think there's a sense.

1568
01:03:55,720 --> 01:04:01,640
Even here that they have become prisoners of the crowd, that they're prisoners of the

1569
01:04:01,640 --> 01:04:03,740
situation that they're trying.

1570
01:04:03,800 --> 01:04:04,920
They're parading.

1571
01:04:04,940 --> 01:04:06,760
They've lost age to appease the crowd.

1572
01:04:06,940 --> 01:04:07,920
Yeah, exactly.

1573
