1578
01:04:27,120 --> 01:04:32,220
So that guy that we mentioned, the Marquis de Ferrières, the nobleman, the Enlightenment

1579
01:04:32,220 --> 01:04:38,920
guy, he writes to his sister the next day and he says, we've come close to the bloodiest

1580
01:04:38,920 --> 01:04:39,300
catastrophe.

