People speak openly in the Palais Royal of massacring us.

1583
01:04:45,560 --> 01:04:47,040
Our houses are marked out for murder.

1584
01:04:47,740 --> 01:04:52,600
He goes on to say, he says, everything may seem tranquil, but the troops are no longer

1585
01:04:52,600 --> 01:04:53,720
obeying their officers.

1586
01:04:53,720 --> 01:04:53,760
They're not.

1587
01:04:53,760 --> 01:04:59,480
He says, the Estates General of 1789 may be celebrated one day, he says, but it will

1588
01:04:59,480 --> 01:05:04,360
be by a banner of blood that will be carried to all the parts of Europe.

1589
01:05:04,620 --> 01:05:08,100
So would it be fair to say, Dominic, that storm clouds really are gathering?

1590
01:05:08,180 --> 01:05:13,120
They are gathering because in the next few days, there are rumors that there are military

1591
