Mirabeau says, does the king doubt the loyalty of his people?

1596
01:05:34,960 --> 01:05:39,560
And Louis has to issue a public statement saying, these troops are to reinforce the

1597
01:05:39,560 --> 01:05:44,200
troops already in Paris, which are proving unreliable, which is true.

1598
01:05:44,460 --> 01:05:50,320
The French guard and the Swiss guard, well, the French guard in particular in Paris, there

