1608
01:06:24,220 --> 01:06:25,100
We have to act.

1609
01:06:27,160 --> 01:06:32,540
This is the last opportunity we'll ever have to seize control of the situation.

1610
01:06:33,320 --> 01:06:34,100
Sack necker.

1611
01:06:34,160 --> 01:06:35,560
Put an end to all of this nonsense.

1612
01:06:35,940 --> 01:06:39,020
Use these new troops from the frontiers to secure the city.

1613
01:06:39,480 --> 01:06:41,660
The question is whether the army will obey orders.

1614
01:06:41,940 --> 01:06:46,400
The royal commander, the Duke de Broglie, says it is risky.

1615
01:06:46,520 --> 01:06:50,060
He says, if we get this wrong, we will not be able.

1616
