the capital.

1627
01:07:25,240 --> 01:07:26,040
And we can't do that.

1628
01:07:26,260 --> 01:07:26,560
Right.

1629
01:07:26,600 --> 01:07:32,460
And, you know, a king leaving his own capital to go inside with foreign powers is not a

1630
